                "text": "Traveling back down to Washington today. Even though Republican Speaker Mike Johnson isn\u2019t having votes in Washington, I'm showing up & ready to work with anyone to end this shutdown, get federal workers paid & back on the job, and stop healthcare costs from spiraling out of control.",
