                "text": "We shouldn't be in this foolish government shutdown in the first place.\n\nSpeaker Mike Johnson needs to bring the House back into session so we can hammer out a deal to get federal workers back on the job & paid, and stop rising healthcare costs & missed SNAP funds from pummeling people.",
