                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I think everyone in Congress should come back to Washington to hash out a deal to end this shutdown and lower healthcare costs.\n\nBut the truth is: if Republican politicians want to re-open the government without working with Democrats, they can. They already get around the Senate filibuster whenever they want to.",
