                "text": "Nearly 186,000 Pennsylvanians rely on the Women, Infants and Children (WIC) program for basic food and healthcare. \n\nThe program is still getting funded\u2014for now\u2014using tariff revenue. \n\nBut we can't risk WIC funds getting cut off.\ufffc [1/2]\n\nhttps://t.co/4Jh2Z11dov",
