                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Americans are already getting pounded by high healthcare costs. I'm not rolling the dice on my constituents\u2019 healthcare on some pathetic promise from the Senate for a future vote that Mike Johnson won\u2019t honor anyway. Nope.",
